<title>INDIA: Indian repo cut-off unchanged at 5.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Indian repo cut-off unchanged at 5.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Thursday it maintained the cut-off at 5.0 percent at its three-day auction of government securities.</p>
<p>The RBI said it accepted all the five bids received, for a total of 13.25 billion rupees.</p>
<p>The weighted-average cut-off worked out to 4.992, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
